%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e9620f8c34305754d8cc9a7e49e852d9, type: 3}
  m_Name: Dialogue_en
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.Localization::UnityEngine.Localization.Tables.StringTable
  m_LocaleId:
    m_Code: en
  m_SharedData: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 043bf15b2a6a41c48971e11c678f419c, type: 2}
  m_Metadata:
    m_Items: []
  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 472199573504
    m_Localized: Why'd you skip all the tasty fruit and snacks and eat a KKUL-TTEOK
      instead?!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 334352332992512
    m_Localized: 'Colored tiles will appear on the floor.

      Stand on one for
      2 seconds and your score goes up.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 334425666203648
    m_Localized: "Anyone can step on white or black tiles, but only your own color
      counts on unique-color tiles.\nDon't block the way \u2014 move fast!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 334428463804416
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3209884708864
    m_Localized: "This game has a Cheer System. \nIf your teammates cheer for you,
      you'll get a buff."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3209884708865
    m_Localized: "There are two ways to cheer: \ntype /cheer Berry in chat, or say
      the Cheer Name with your voice."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3209884708866
    m_Localized: "In multiplayer, all teammates (except you) must cheer for you to
      activate the buff. \nIn solo, cheer for yourself."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3209884708867
    m_Localized: "Stealth is available. \nPress [Ctrl] to switch between Black and
      White. \nMatch the floor color to avoid detection by enemies and some traps."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 335177390338048
    m_Localized: 'Press <color=#FFD24D><b>Space</b></color> when your color lights
      up on the floor.

      Anyone can press for white, but don''t press for black!

      Black
      will move to the next turn automatically after 1 second.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 335182629023744
    m_Localized: 'Something''s moving under our feet..watch out!

      It''s a tongue
      attack!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 335185439207424
    m_Localized: 'The tongue will smash the platform in the center and block the
      way.

      Everyone shout the team cheer to bring it back down and repair
      the broken path.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 335887280484352
    m_Localized: 'Feels like it''s working out! Its breathing suddenly got rough.

      Here
      comes the wind! Get on the matching tile and hold your ground!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 335890795311104
    m_Localized: Haah... haah... just a little more and we might actually make it
      out alive...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 335893903290368
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 337052009345024
    m_Localized: '...It''s gone quiet in here.

      Does that mean we can finally
      escape...?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 337056501444608
    m_Localized: .....(CRUNCH!)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 337060553142272
    m_Localized: Oh no, we're being swallowed...!!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 337068631371776
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 337070598500352
    m_Localized: We got swallowed and ended up in the esophagus... At this point,
      there's nothing to do but head down and escape.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 337897539088384
    m_Localized: The esophagus is going to squeeze in on us at random intervals.
      When the warning pops up, everyone shout the team cheer to stop it!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 337902496755712
    m_Localized: "Colored walls will push in from both sides. If a wall shows your
      color, slam right into it \u2014 it'll get knocked back."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 337904153505792
    m_Localized: Remember only the glowing tiles. Step on the wrong one and it's
      an instant kill.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 337904874926080
    m_Localized: This time it'll show tiles by color. You have to match your own
      color! Even if the color's right, you'll still die if it's in black-and-white
      mode.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 337905520848896
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 337906154188800
    m_Localized: Each zone has an assigned color. The path only becomes safe once
      that color goes through first! Stick to the order!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 337906812694528
    m_Localized: "Go catch those red blood cells running around \u2014 let's land
      some damage on this body. We can't just keep taking hits!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 337907517337600
    m_Localized: Catching those red blood cells made the white blood cells mark us
      as enemies! Run and survive!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 339357207212032
    m_Localized: This is the last stretch of the esophagus... below here has to be
      full of stomach acid. Going down unprepared is way too risky.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 339360646541312
    m_Localized: "That candy from before is coming down from the ceiling, and it's
      bigger now. We need to build a floor before it hits bottom \u2014 or we'll
      get swept down with it."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 339362018078720
    m_Localized: Clearing each section builds part of the floor. Hurry and build
      it to block that thing!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 340094578438144
    m_Localized: Phew... we barely held it back... now let's think about how to get
      down safely from here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 340096402960384
    m_Localized: Gulp... gulp... what is that sound...?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 340097782886400
    m_Localized: Its throat's clogged and it's starting to drink water! The candy's
      breaking through the floor!!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 350000000000001
    m_Localized: 'They say you can survive even a tiger''s den if you keep your wits
      about you..!

      From now on, just focus on staying alive.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 350000000000002
    m_Localized: 'Remember where the colored mouths around you are.

      Step on
      the pad, and that color''s mouth will rise up and smash the teeth.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 350000000000003
    m_Localized: 'Only one color rises at a time.

      Stepping on it together
      won''t help.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 350000000000004
    m_Localized: 'If this place starts to close... everyone shout the team cheer!

      Otherwise
      you won''t be able to see a thing.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 350000000000005
    m_Localized: Get into the safe zone shown on screen!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 350000000000006
    m_Localized: 'Did it eat something spicy before swallowing me..?

      Drool
      keeps rising up from the floor.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 350000000000007
    m_Localized: 'The floor''s covered in slippery drool.

      Everyone shout the
      team cheer together to clear it.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 350000000000008
    m_Localized: 'Now it''s dripping from above too!

      It must''ve eaten something
      spicy, then something sour on top of that.

      It''s definitely trying to
      neutralize it with a KKUL-TTEOK!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 350000000000009
    m_Localized: "Some of the falling drops are targeting me \u2014 press <color=#FFD24D><b>Ctrl</b></color>
      to match the floor color to your own and break the lock-on."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 350000000000010
    m_Localized: 'From now on, it''ll only show you one tile ahead.

      Remember
      it well!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 350000000000011
    m_Localized: 'There''s something targeting me here too.

      Press <color=#FFD24D><b>Ctrl</b></color>
      to match the floor color to your own and break the lock-on.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 350000000000012
    m_Localized: "This time the tongue will smash the entire left or right floor.\nShout
      the team cheer to block it \u2014 if you don't, it'll just break."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 350000000000013
    m_Localized: 'It only repairs if you shout the team cheer while the warning is
      up.

      Once the floor breaks, you''ll just have to hold out until the next
      warning.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12337130970394624
    m_Localized: ...rumble, rumble? Don't tell me that's the candy rolling toward
      us?! Run if you don't want to get flattened!!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12337131016531968
    m_Localized: A burp got stuck in the esophagus... gas is starting to build up.
      If it gets too thick to see through, shout the team cheer to clear it out.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12337131016531969
    m_Localized: "Watch your step. Feels like acid reflux \u2014 that's stomach acid
      coming up!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12337131016531970
    m_Localized: Spike attacks will come from places you can't see. Stay alert at
      all times.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12337131016531971
    m_Localized: The walls on both sides will turn black-and-white. Match the color
      and slam into the wall to push back the pressure!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12337131016531972
    m_Localized: "Must be an allergic reaction \u2014 swelling's popped up all through
      the esophagus. Bump into one of these and you'll get knocked flying."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12337131016531973
    m_Localized: Bump into a wall and you'll get knocked back. Might be able to use
      that to get away, huh?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12337131037503488
    m_Localized: AAAAAAAAAH...!!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds: []
